*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# This project's .env holds build-time configuration only — VITE_API_MODE and
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — and no secrets. It is committed on purpose so the team
# shares one API configuration. Anything prefixed VITE_ is exposed in the
# browser bundle, so never put a password, key or connection string here.
!.env
